	\L_0186a:
	!VAR0516 : 403!
	\L_018da:
	\L_01816:
	ZH 1:
	'Huhu... You’re so interesting,'
	R
	'Sir Rick.'
	\L_0193b:
	\L_0192e:
	\L_01886:
	ZH 1:
	'Huh...? Not really...'
	\L_0193b:
	\L_0192e:
	\L_01816:
	ZH 1:
	'But...'
	R
	'You work so hard...'
	R
	'And you’re pretty cute...'
	\L_0193b:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah... Sorry.'
	R
	'You probably don’t want to'
	R
	'hear that at your age...'
	\L_0193b:
	\L_0192e:
	\L_01886:
	ZH 1:
	'No, it’s fine...'
	\L_0193b:
	\L_0192e:
	\L_01816:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah, Your Majesty.'
	R
	'How are you?'
	\L_0193b:
	\L_0192e:
	\L_01886:
	ZH 1:
	'Huh...?'
	\L_0193b:
	\L_0192e:
	\L_01878:
	!VAR0516 : 1!
	\L_0186a:
	\L_01816:
	ZH 1:
	'Mhm.'
	R
	'Pretty good, thanks.'
	\L_0193b:
	\L_0192e:
	\L_01878:
	!VAR0516 : 36!
	\L_0186a:
	\L_01816:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah, do you have business with'
	R
	'Sir Rick? Excuse me, then.'
	\L_0193b:
	\L_0192e:
	\L_01878:
	!VAR0516 : 1!
	\L_0186a:
	\L_01816:
	ZH 1:
	'You...'
	\L_0193b:
	\L_0192e:
	\L_0184e:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance looked at Wendy’s ass'
	R
	'while she walked off as he'
	R
	'spoke.'
	\L_0193b:
	\L_0192e:
	\L_01886:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes?'
	\L_0193b:
	\L_0192e:
	\L_01816:
	ZH 1:
	'Are you and Wendy intimate?'
	\L_0193b:
	\L_0192e:
	\L_01886:
	ZH 1:
	'N-No!'
	R
	'That’s not...'
	\L_0193b:
	\L_0192e:
	\L_01816:
	ZH 1:
	'When I see flirting like'
	R
	'that...'
	\L_0193b:
	ZH 1:
	'Then it makes me think you’re'
	R
	'already fucking!!'
	\L_0193b:
	\L_0192e:
	\L_01886:
	ZH 1:
	'K-King... I...'
	\L_0193b:
	\L_0192e:
	\L_01816:
	ZH 1:
	'Gahahahahahahaha.'
	R
	'I’m just screwing with you.'
	\L_0193b:
	\L_0192e:
	\L_01886:
	ZH 1:
	'Huh...?'
	\L_0193b:
	ZH 1:
	'...Ah...'
	\L_0193b:
	ZH 1:
	'Aah... You do like making'
	R
	'trouble for people, King...'
	\L_0193b:
	\L_0192e:
	\L_01816:
	ZH 1:
	'Gahahahahaha.'
	\L_0193b:
	ZH 1:
	'Aah～, that was fun.'
	R
	'See you.'
	\L_0193b:
	\L_0192e:
	\L_01886:
	ZH 1:
	'Huh?'
	R
	'Did you not need anything with'
	R
	'me?'
	\L_0193b:
	\L_0192e:
	\L_01816:
	ZH 1:
	'I forgot what it was.'
	R
	'I’ll come back when I remember.'
	\L_0193b:
	\L_0192e:
	\L_01886:
	ZH 1:
	'Understood.'
	\L_0193b:
